{
  "title": "Reflex | Circuit breaker operations",
  "description": "Client outcomes, server pressure, circuit state and application-wide Jev telemetry. Select a simulation_run and its historical time range. HTTP and breaker widgets target Datadog-evidence mode; SDK widgets are application-wide.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "auto",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "defaults": [
        "local"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "policy",
      "prefix": "policy",
      "defaults": [
        "jev"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "run",
      "prefix": "simulation_run",
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "application",
      "prefix": "service",
      "defaults": [
        "reflex"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Circuit breaker operations\nSelect an environment, policy and **simulation run**; choose the corresponding time range. This dashboard targets run-tagged metrics from Datadog-evidence mode. Run `*` combines runs; select one run to interpret breaker state.\n**Closed** allows traffic \u00b7 **Open** blocks traffic \u00b7 **Probe** admits a recovery request. No change is a decision, not a fourth state.\nRequests are counted at their terminal outcome. Rates use wall time; HTTP durations use simulation time (aligned at 1\u00d7 playback). Missing data is not treated as healthy.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Client outcomes \u2014 selected time range",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "background_color": "blue",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 2,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Completed client requests",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:http.client.requests{$env AND $policy AND $run AND upstream IN (catalog,payments,search)}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Successful client requests",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:http.client.requests{$env AND $policy AND $run AND upstream IN (catalog,payments,search) AND outcome:success}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Client failure % \u2014 excludes blocked",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:http.client.requests{$env AND $policy AND $run AND upstream IN (catalog,payments,search) AND outcome IN (http_error,timeout)}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q2",
                      "query": "sum:http.client.requests{$env AND $policy AND $run AND upstream IN (catalog,payments,search) AND outcome IN (success,http_error,timeout)}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "100 * q1 / q2"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 1,
              "autoscale": true,
              "custom_unit": "%"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 5,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Blocked client requests",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:http.client.requests{$env AND $policy AND $run AND upstream IN (catalog,payments,search) AND outcome:circuit_open}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
